{
  "name": "@civitai/app-sdk",
  "version": "0.44.0",
  "description": "OAuth + PKCE, encrypted-cookie sessions, scopes, and orchestrator helpers for building third-party Civitai apps.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "sideEffects": [
    "./dist/safe-storage/index.js",
    "./dist/blocks/index.js"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./oauth": {
      "types": "./dist/oauth/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/oauth/index.js"
    },
    "./scopes": {
      "types": "./dist/scopes/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/scopes/index.js"
    },
    "./cookies": {
      "types": "./dist/cookies/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/cookies/index.js"
    },
    "./orchestrator": {
      "types": "./dist/orchestrator/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/orchestrator/index.js"
    },
    "./orchestrator/steps": {
      "types": "./dist/orchestrator/steps.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/orchestrator/steps.js"
    },
    "./blocks": {
      "types": "./dist/blocks/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/blocks/index.js"
    },
    "./safe-storage": {
      "types": "./dist/safe-storage/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/safe-storage/index.js"
    },
    "./schemas/app-block/v1.json": "./schemas/app-block/v1.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "schemas",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "test:types": "tsc -p tsconfig.typecheck.json",
    "test": "vitest run && tsc -p tsconfig.typecheck.json",
    "test:watch": "vitest"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "comment-peerDependencies": [
    "@civitai/client is consumed for TYPES ONLY, by `./orchestrator/steps`.",
    "It is an OPTIONAL peer, never a dependency: `dependencies` is empty on",
    "purpose (this package ships into sandboxed browser iframes and every app",
    "inherits its install graph), and @civitai/client has no types-only entry",
    "point -- it ships .d.ts beside .js in one package with a real runtime",
    "(@hey-api/client-fetch, rfc6902, tslib). Optional-peer keeps that graph",
    "out of every app that does not ask for the step types, and keeps the",
    "version the APP's choice.",
    "",
    "🔴 THE PIN IS NOT `latest` AND MUST NOT BECOME IT. @civitai/client's npm",
    "`latest` dist-tag is 0.1.1-beta.0; the version the orchestrator is",
    "actually generated against ships under the `beta` tag (0.2.0-beta.98 as of",
    "this writing -- cross-checked against what civitai/civitai resolves).",
    "`pnpm add @civitai/client` therefore installs something ~97 betas behind",
    "and MISSING MOST STEP TYPES, with no error. The range below deliberately",
    "excludes 0.1.x: verify with",
    "`semver.satisfies('0.1.1-beta.0', '^0.2.0-beta.98')` === false.",
    "Install with the tag: `pnpm add -D @civitai/client@beta`."
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@civitai/client": "^0.2.0-beta.98"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@civitai/client": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@civitai/client": "0.2.0-beta.98",
    "@types/node": "^25.9.1",
    "typescript": "^5.9.2",
    "vitest": "^4.1.11"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "civitai",
    "oauth",
    "pkce",
    "sdk",
    "orchestrator",
    "ai",
    "generation",
    "session",
    "encrypted-cookie"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/civitai/civitai-app-starters/tree/main/packages/civitai-app-sdk#readme",
  "bugs": "https://github.com/civitai/civitai-app-starters/issues",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/civitai/civitai-app-starters.git",
    "directory": "packages/civitai-app-sdk"
  }
}
